msgstr "循环闹钟提示音 6。"

msgid "Looping alarm sound 7."
msgstr "循环闹钟提示音 7。"

msgid "Looping alarm sound 8."
msgstr "循环闹钟提示音 8。"

msgid "Looping alarm sound 9."
msgstr "循环闹钟提示音 9。"

msgid "Looping alarm sound 10."
msgstr "循环闹钟提示音 10。"

msgid "Looping call sound."
msgstr "循环来电提示音。"

msgid "Looping call sound 1."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 1。"

msgid "Looping call sound 2."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 2。"

msgid "Looping call sound 3."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 3。"

msgid "Looping call sound 4."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 4。"

msgid "Looping call sound 5."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 5。"

msgid "Looping call sound 6."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 6。"

msgid "Looping call sound 7."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 7。"

msgid "Looping call sound 8."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 8。"

msgid "Looping call sound 9."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 9。"

msgid "Looping call sound 10."
msgstr "循环来电提示音 10。"

msgid "Presentation options for [method WinToaster.show_toast]."
msgstr "[method WinToaster.show_toast] 的展示选项。"

msgid "Every property has a default value, so only the ones that should differ from the defaults need to be set. Create one instance and reuse it for multiple toasts if the settings stay the same."
msgstr "每个属性都有默认值，因此只需设置需要与默认值不同的属性。如果设置保持不变，可以创建一个实例并复用于多个 toast。"

msgid "Labels of action buttons shown on the toast. Windows supports at most 5; extra entries are ignored. Clicking a button emits [signal WinToaster.toast_action] with its zero-based index."
msgstr "toast 上显示的操作按钮文本。Windows 最多支持 5 个，多余的条目会被忽略。点击按钮会发出 [signal WinToaster.toast_action]，并附带其从 0 开始的索引。"

msgid "How the toast sound is played: once, silently, or in a loop."
msgstr "toast 声音的播放方式：播放一次、静音或循环播放。"

msgid "How long the toast stays on screen."
msgstr "toast 在屏幕上停留的时长。"

msgid "Absolute path to a PNG, JPG or GIF displayed in the toast. Empty means no icon. SVG is not supported by Windows toast images."
msgstr "toast 中显示的 PNG、JPG 或 GIF 文件的绝对路径。为空表示不显示图标。Windows toast 图片不支持 SVG。"

msgid "How the icon is cropped (square or circle)."
msgstr "图标的裁剪方式（正方形或圆形）。"

msgid "If [code]true[/code], toasts currently displayed or queued by this app are hidden first so the new toast appears immediately."
msgstr "如果为 [code]true[/code]，会先隐藏此应用当前显示或排队的 toast，使新 toast 立即出现。"

msgid "System sound to play. Custom audio files are not reliably available to unpackaged desktop apps, so system sounds are preferred."
msgstr "要播放的系统声音。自定义音频文件对未打包的桌面应用并不可靠，因此建议使用系统声音。"
